Cell["\<\
(poster method) r = 3, s = 5 \[Rule] 5 - 3 = 2, so climb up to 3 and stay \
there for 2 more times until climbing back down.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0015034919152517`*^9, 
  4.0015035793546267`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"83dc5c2d-3fe1-4c6d-afc9-\
