Cell["\<\
so for this one, 396/9801 reduces to 4/99 by a factor of 99, and 198/99 = 2, \
thus the length of the string of the repeating block is 2.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001702020465137*^9, 
  4.0017020747207823`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e7a675b1-e42d-479f-93e0-\
f5202dbf1056"],

